Heat-up learning algorithm notes
================================

Model 0 (EMA recovery rate) and Model 3 (weather-compensated linear /
multi-factor OLS with weather factor WF) formulas are reimplemented in
TypeScript based on the educational descriptions in:

  https://github.com/bbartling/hvac-optimal-start-math-playground
  License: MIT

No upstream source files were copied. Lifecycle design patterns
(arrival-bounded learning, observation-only on constrained cycles,
asymmetric early bias) informed by:

  https://github.com/dbullendsl/hvac-comfort-start
  License: MIT

  (design patterns only — no Home Assistant / pyscript code.)

Outdoor weather: Bright Sky (DWD Open Data) + Open-Meteo fallback.
No Home Assistant custom_components code is included.
